Privacy Policy

Last updated: July 24, 2026

This application is a personal content management and publishing tool. It is used only by its owner to manage and publish content to their own social media accounts.

Information We Collect

This app accesses and processes data necessary to publish content to connected social media accounts, including access tokens, account identifiers, and content metadata (captions, hashtags, media files) required for publishing.

How Information Is Used

Information is used solely to generate, schedule, and publish social media content on behalf of the app owner. No data is sold, shared, or used for any purpose beyond operating this application.

Data Storage

Access tokens and credentials are stored securely and are not shared with third parties, except as required to communicate with the respective social media platforms' official APIs (Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, X, LinkedIn).

Third-Party Services

This app communicates with third-party platform APIs (Meta, TikTok, YouTube/Google, X, LinkedIn) solely to publish content. Each platform's own privacy policy governs their handling of any data once received.

Data Retention

Data is retained only as long as necessary to operate the app and is deleted upon request.

Your Rights

The app owner may request deletion of any stored data at any time.

Changes to This Policy

This policy may be updated at any time without prior notice.

Contact

For questions about this privacy policy, contact the app owner directly.
